   {
    "row": 10,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "in an average of 362.41s, while GPT-Pilot takes the longest at 1622.38s. On average, a full evaluation on",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 647,
     "end": 752
    },
    "digest": "99b1f24a5b77d39321dc0b60818bc2a5c0e068bcbfca0562d074e9b7e5011824"
   },
   {
    "row": 11,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "DevAI with one of these three took around 210.65 USD and 14 hours to perform. While running, GPT-Pilot",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 752,
     "end": 854
    },
    "digest": "ed4391d23006e51409c91e0f6e9f55cb2325c27f17c82edee2647e703ecfb7ae"
   },
   {
    "row": 12,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "generates the most output tokens at 59707 tokens, whereas OpenHands processed the most at 1252482 tokens",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 854,
     "end": 958
    },
    "digest": "f51a6e76af24c49e3cf42a79ca6837ac5bc1ac188b2f3424fba97b1b83659de0"
   },
   {
    "row": 13,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "while producing the fewest at 8457 tokens. This suggests that OpenHands's internal communication is more",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 958,
     "end": 1062
    },
    "digest": "5cb08fe8f9f8c6c89eb88e543aa473d86564ae4b176953465aedf06776cc0a1c"
   },
   {
    "row": 14,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 2,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "complicated but is more parsimonious in its decisions.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1062,
     "end": 1116
    },
    "digest": "ccd0b93afde48bc95988e7f5e2bc3e4a98c815e66c0b8cc56aabf3761b8b7638"
   },
   {
    "row": 14,
    "column": 2,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1116,
     "end": 1116
    },
    "digest": "2424f37d732047ceba2313760da7ce97beb204251478977456f40d393f7dd5b1"
   },
   {
    "row": 14,
    "column": 3,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1116,
     "end": 1116
    },
    "digest": "21ad80e642db9e097de2a8a9191d9420891ad177ed3e9221cd4680641b05f850"
   },
   {
    "row": 15,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "MetaGPT, while being the most cost-effective, generates fewer saved code files (0.42), suggesting it may be",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1116,
     "end": 1223
    },
    "digest": "f1cfa196678ad83daa631b6bf6224f1e515331302dc18bdf4ce92e9877be0608"
   },
   {
    "row": 16,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "less inclined to save files. In contrast, GPT-Pilot generates the most saved files (3.84), reflecting a more",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1223,
     "end": 1331
    },
    "digest": "91f89b50961e9b1b91bba9a6c2073cf920338cadf01b5ef86f7a7859c7be3b8b"
   },
   {
    "row": 17,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "prolific output. The difference in saved code lines, with GPT-Pilot saving 273.33 lines versus MetaGPT's",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1331,
     "end": 1435
    },
    "digest": "ba33ec084f09ffb5e101cfd6520d821e12447f2710de67eaeb88e254cf68a0cb"
   },
   {
    "row": 18,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "11.15, underscores GPT-Pilot's extensive output. Meanwhile, OpenHands, despite handling larger inputs,",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1435,
     "end": 1537
    },
    "digest": "d57dd399e5cda3f041e8a8907f995ac832b437be002b0ee497cabbac80b4f0af"
   },
   {
    "row": 19,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "seems less focused on executing code to generate files, as evidenced by its lower file output (2.53 saved files).",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1537,
     "end": 1650
    },
    "digest": "0e8495d81c521594ceac2d5d9ea7a559d7845b3d8ad72fe0c934504d97c9cf56"
   }
